5)How would you ensure resource quotas and limits are effectively enforced in a multi-tenant OpenShift environment?
“To enforce resource usage in a multi-tenant OpenShift environment, I apply ResourceQuotas at project level and LimitRanges to enforce default and maximum limits per container. 
For teams with multiple namespaces, I use ClusterResourceQuotas. I also implement governance using OPA/Gatekeeper policies to block resources without proper limits, and
I continuously monitor quota usage with alerts.
This ensures fair resource distribution, prevents noisy neighbors, and maintains cluster stability.”

