13)How do you view logs for a specific pod in OpenShift?
To view pod logs in OpenShift, I use oc logs <pod-name> or oc logs -f to stream logs. 
If the pod has multiple containers, I specify the container using -c. 
I can also use the OpenShift Web Console under Workloads → Pods → Logs to view and filter logs.

